A '''Dark Candy''' is a {{Rare}} item obtained during the [[Great Spook]] that can be used to purchase items from {{NPCSprite|Vargul the Unearthed}}.

== Obtaining ==
=== Mob Drops ===
'''Dark Candy''' is obtained by killing {{MobSprite|Primal Fear}}s and the mobs they turn into after killing them.

== Usage ==
=== Shop Purchase ===
'''Dark Candy''' can be given to {{NPCSprite|Vargul the Unearthed}} in {{Zone|Unincorporated}} for various items.
